{"id":"96c7f9f517a9005db1c5f0eaf92bea3ea51ce986","axis":"silent","repo":"TYPO3/typo3","sha":"96c7f9f517a9005db1c5f0eaf92bea3ea51ce986","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Documentation/Changelog/15.0/Feature-111374-ConfigurationModuleDataOnTheCommandLine.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,69 @@","+..  include:: /Includes.rst.txt","+","+..  _feature-111374-1793279548:","+","+================================================================","+Feature: #111374 - Configuration module data on the command line","+================================================================","+","+See :issue:`111374`","+","+Description","+===========","+","+The data of the :guilabel:`System > Configuration` backend module is now","+available on the command line as :bash:`vendor/bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect`. The","+command reads the same providers as the module, including the ones extensions","+register with the :yaml:`lowlevel.configuration.module.provider` service tag,","+and needs no backend login. This helps over SSH, in deployment scripts, when","+comparing environments and for AI coding agents working in a project.","+","+..  code-block:: bash","+","+    # All providers, grouped as in the backend module","+    vendor/bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect","+","+    # One provider, narrowed down with one argument per key level","+    vendor/bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect tca tt_content columns header","+    vendor/bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect confVars SYS sitename","+","+    # Complete output for scripts","+    vendor/bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect tca --flat | grep renderType","+    vendor/bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect httpMiddlewareStacks frontend --json","+","+By default, the output is a tree: an overview of about 200 lines in which every","+entry of the first level is listed, branches that don't fit are shown as","+complete JSON on one line or as a shortened preview, and a closing hint says","+what was cut. :bash:`--depth` shows a fixed number of levels instead,","+:bash:`--depth=0` everything. :bash:`--flat` writes one line per value with its","+path, which can be pasted back as arguments, and :bash:`--json` writes JSON.","+Both are always complete and are refused above 1 MB unless","+:bash:`--no-size-limit` is given.","+","+:bash:`--resolve-labels` translates label references such as","+:php:`'LLL:EXT:frontend/Resources/Private/Language/locallang_ttc.xlf:header'`","+into English, :bash:`--resolve-labels=de` into another installed language. In","+the tree, the original reference follows as a comment.","+","+Errors are written to stderr. The command exits with code 2 for invalid input,","+such as an unknown provider or key, and with code 1 if a provider cannot be","+read on the command line or the output is too large. Provider identifiers,","+keys and languages are offered by the shell completion.","+","+Options blinded in the module, such as the database credentials and the","+encryption key, are blinded on the command line as well.","+","+Impact","+======","+","+Integrators, developers, scripts and AI agents can inspect the configuration,","+TCA, event listeners, middlewares, routes, backend modules, site sets and the","+other data of the Configuration module without logging in to the backend.","+","+Listeners to","+:php:`\\TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Event\\ModifyBlindedConfigurationOptionsEvent` are now","+also called on the command line, where there is no request and no","+authenticated backend user. A listener that blinds options must not depend on","+either, or the command shows options that the module hides.","+","+..  index:: CLI, ext:lowlevel"],"additions":69,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/lowlevel/Classes/Command/InspectCommand.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,363 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Command;","+","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Attribute\\AsCommand;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Command\\Command;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Completion\\CompletionInput;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Completion\\CompletionSuggestions;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Formatter\\OutputFormatter;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Formatter\\OutputFormatterStyle;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Helper\\Table;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Helper\\TableCell;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Helper\\TableSeparator;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Input\\InputArgument;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Input\\InputInterface;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Input\\InputOption;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Output\\OutputInterface;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Output\\StreamOutput;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Style\\SymfonyStyle;","+use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Terminal;","+use Symfony\\Component\\DependencyInjection\\Attribute\\Autowire;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Attribute\\AsNonSchedulableCommand;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Cache\\Frontend\\FrontendInterface;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Localization\\LanguageService;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Localization\\LanguageServiceFactory;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Core\\Localization\\Locales;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\ConfigurationModuleProvider\\ProviderRegistry;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector\\DataNormalizer;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector\\FlatRenderer;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector\\LabelResolver;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector\\StyledText;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector\\TreeRenderer;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector\\ValueFormatter;","+","+/**","+ * Shows the data of the providers of the Configuration backend module.","+ *","+ * @internal This class is a specific command implementation and is not part of the TYPO3's Core API.","+ */","+#[AsCommand('lowlevel:inspect', 'Shows the data of the Configuration module providers')]","+#[AsNonSchedulableCommand]","+final class InspectCommand extends Command","+{","+    private const int SIZE_LIMIT = 1_000_000;","+    private const int WIDTH_WITHOUT_TERMINAL = 120;","+    private const int MIN_WIDTH = 40;","+    private const int COMPLETION_LIFETIME = 60;","+","+    public function __construct(","+        #[Autowire(lazy: true)]","+        private readonly ProviderRegistry $providerRegistry,","+        private readonly DataNormalizer $dataNormalizer,","+        private readonly LabelResolver $labelResolver,","+        private readonly TreeRenderer $treeRenderer,","+        private readonly FlatRenderer $flatRenderer,","+        private readonly ValueFormatter $valueFormatter,","+        private readonly LanguageServiceFactory $languageServiceFactory,","+        private readonly Locales $locales,","+        #[Autowire(service: 'cache.lowlevel_inspect')]","+        private readonly FrontendInterface $completionCache,","+    ) {","+        parent::__construct();","+    }","+","+    protected function configure(): void","+    {","+        $this->setHelp(","+            'Shows what the Configuration backend module shows: configuration, registries and wiring.' . LF . LF","+            . 'Without arguments, all providers are listed. Each further argument selects one key level.' . LF","+            . 'The tree is an overview of about ' . TreeRenderer::BUDGET . ' lines; flat and json are always complete.' . LF . LF","+            . 'Examples:' . LF","+            . '  <info>bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect</info>' . LF","+            . '  <info>bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect tca tt_content columns header</info>' . LF","+            . '  <info>bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect confVars SYS sitename</info>' . LF","+            . '  <info>bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect httpMiddlewareStacks frontend --json</info>' . LF","+            . '  <info>bin/typo3 lowlevel:inspect tca --flat | grep renderType</info>' . LF . LF","+            . 'Place --resolve-labels after the path segments or write --resolve-labels=<lang>:' . LF","+            . 'a following argument without \"-\" is taken as the language.' . LF . LF","+            . 'For filtered or tabular views of single providers see configuration:show, debug:backend:routes,' . LF","+            . 'debug:backend:modules, language:domain:list, site:sets:list, site:show and fluid:namespaces.'","+        );","+        $this->addArgument('provider', InputArgument::OPTIONAL, 'Identifier of the provider, as listed without arguments');","+        $this->addArgument('path', InputArgument::IS_ARRAY | InputArgument::OPTIONAL, 'Keys to select, one argument per level');","+        $this->addOption('flat', null, InputOption::VALUE_NONE, 'Output one line per value with its path instead of the tree');","+        $this->addOption('json', null, InputOption::VALUE_NONE, 'Output as JSON instead of the tree');","+        $this->addOption('depth', 'd', InputOption::VALUE_REQUIRED, 'Tree only: levels to show instead of the line budget, 0 for everything');","+        $this->addOption('no-size-limit', null, InputOption::VALUE_NONE, 'flat and json only: allow output above 1 MB');","+        $this->addOption('resolve-labels', null, InputOption::VALUE_OPTIONAL, 'Translate label references, in English or the given language', false);","+    }","+","+    protected function execute(InputInterface $input, OutputInterface $output): int","+    {","+        $errorIo = new SymfonyStyle($input, $output)->getErrorStyle();","+        $this->registerStyles($output);","+","+        $flat = (bool)$input->getOption('flat');","+        $json = (bool)$input->getOption('json');","+        $format = match (true) {","+            $json => 'json',","+            $flat => 'flat',","+            default => 'tree',","+        };","+        $depth = $input->getOption('depth');","+        $provider = $input->getArgument('provider');","+        $noSizeLimit = (bool)$input->getOption('no-size-limit');","+        $languageOption = $input->getOption('resolve-labels');","+        $resolveLabels = $languageOption !== false;","+        $language = is_string($languageOption) && $languageOption !== '' ? $languageOption : 'en';","+","+        $invalidInput = match (true) {","+            $flat && $json => '--flat and --json cannot be combined.',","+            $depth !== null && $format !== 'tree' => '--depth only applies to the tree. --flat and --json are always complete; narrow them with path segments.',","+            $depth !== null && $provider === null => '--depth needs a provider. The provider list has no depth.',","+            $depth !== null && !preg_match('/^\\d+$/', (string)$depth) => '--depth expects a number of levels, 0 for everything.',","+            $noSizeLimit && $format === 'tree' => '--no-size-limit only applies to --flat and --json. The tree uses a ' . TreeRenderer::BUDGET . '-line budget; pass --depth=0 for everything.',","+            !$this->locales->isValidLanguageKey($language) => sprintf('Unknown language \"%s\". Use a language code such as de, fr, en.', $language),","+            default => null,","+        };","+        if ($invalidInput !== null) {","+            $errorIo->error($invalidInput);","+            return Command::INVALID;","+        }","+","+        $languageService = $this->languageServiceFactory->create($language);","+        // Provider and group labels are always translated, in English unless another language is requested.","+        $GLOBALS['LANG'] = $languageService;","+","+        if ($provider === null) {","+            return $this->listProviders($format, $languageService, $output);","+        }","+        if (!$this->providerRegistry->hasProvider($provider)) {","+            $errorIo->error(sprintf('No provider \"%s\". Run \"lowlevel:inspect\" to list all providers.', $provider));","+            return Command::INVALID;","+        }","+        try {","+            $data = $this->dataNormalizer->normalize($this->providerRegistry->getProvider($provider)->getConfiguration());","+        } catch (\\Throwable $e) {","+            $errorIo->error(sprintf('Provider \"%s\" cannot be shown on the command line: %s', $provider, $e->getMessage()));","+            return Command::FAILURE;","+        }","+","+        $selected = [$provider];","+        foreach ($input->getArgument('path') as $segment) {","+            if (!is_array($data)) {","+                $errorIo->error(sprintf('\"%s\" is a single value and has no key \"%s\".', implode(' ', $selected), $segment));","+                return Command::INVALID;","+            }","+            if (!array_key_exists($segment, $data)) {","+                $errorIo->error(sprintf('Key \"%s\" not found in \"%s\".', $segment, implode(' ', $selected)) . $this->didYouMean($segment, array_keys($data)));","+                return Command::INVALID;","+            }","+            $data = $data[$segment];","+            $selected[] = $segment;","+        }","+        if ($resolveLabels) {","+            $data = $this->labelResolver->resolve($data, $languageService);","+        }","+","+        return match ($format) {","+            'tree' => $this->writeLines($this->treeRenderer->render($data, $this->outputWidth($output), $depth === null ? null : (int)$depth), $output),","+            'flat' => $this->writeFlat($this->flatRenderer->render($data), $noSizeLimit, $output, $errorIo),","+            'json' => $this->writeJson($this->valueFormatter->toPlainData($data), $noSizeLimit, $output, $errorIo),","+        };","+    }","+","+    public function complete(CompletionInput $input, CompletionSuggestions $suggestions): void","+    {","+        if ($input->mustSuggestOptionValuesFor('resolve-labels')) {","+            $suggestions->suggestValues($this->locales->getActiveLanguages());","+        } elseif ($input->mustSuggestArgumentValuesFor('provider')) {","+            $suggestions->suggestValues(array_map('strval', array_keys($this->providerRegistry->getProviders())));","+        } elseif ($input->mustSuggestArgumentValuesFor('path')) {","+            $path = $input->getArgument('path');","+            if ($path !== [] && end($path) === $input->getCompletionValue()) {","+                array_pop($path);","+            }","+            $suggestions->suggestValues($this->keysAt((string)$input->getArgument('provider'), $path));","+        }","+    }","+","+    private function listProviders(string $format, LanguageService $languageService, OutputInterface $output): int","+    {","+        $entries = [];","+        foreach ($this->providerRegistry->getGroupedProviders() as $group => $providers) {","+            $groupLabel = $this->providerRegistry->getGroupLabel((string)$group, $languageService);","+            foreach ($providers as $provider) {","+                $entries[] = [","+                    'identifier' => $provider->getIdentifier(),","+                    'label' => $provider->getLabel(),","+                    'group' => (string)$group,","+                    'groupLabel' => $groupLabel,","+                ];","+            }","+        }","+        if ($format === 'json') {","+            $output->writeln($this->valueFormatter->json($entries), OutputInterface::OUTPUT_RAW);","+            return Command::SUCCESS;","+        }","+        if ($format === 'flat') {","+            $lines = [];","+            foreach ($entries as $entry) {","+                $lines[] = $this->valueFormatter->keys([$entry['identifier']])","+                    ->append(' = ', StyledText::STYLE_DIM)","+                    ->concat($this->valueFormatter->value($entry['label']));","+            }","+            return $this->writeLines($lines, $output);","+        }","+        $table = new Table($output);","+        $table->setHeaders(['Identifier', 'Label']);","+        $currentGroup = null;","+        foreach ($entries as $entry) {","+            if ($entry['group'] !== $currentGroup) {","+                if ($currentGroup !== null) {","+                    $table->addRow(new TableSeparator());","+                }","+                $currentGroup = $entry['group'];","+                $table->addRow([new TableCell('<options=bold>' . $this->escapeTableCell($entry['groupLabel']) . '</>', ['colspan' => 2])]);","+            }","+            $table->addRow([","+                '<' . StyledText::STYLE_KEY . '>' . $this->escapeTableCell($entry['identifier']) . '</>',","+                $this->escapeTableCell($entry['label']),","+            ]);","+        }","+        $table->render();","+        return Command::SUCCESS;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Table counts the backslash of an escaped \">\" into the cell width, and only \"<\" opens a tag.","+     */","+    private function escapeTableCell(string $text): string","+    {","+        return str_replace('\\\\>', '>', OutputFormatter::escape($this->valueFormatter->escapeUnsafeCharacters($text)));","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * @param list<StyledText> $lines","+     */","+    private function writeLines(array $lines, OutputInterface $output): int","+    {","+        foreach ($lines as $line) {","+            $output->writeln($line->format());","+        }","+        return Command::SUCCESS;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * @param list<StyledText> $lines","+     */","+    private function writeFlat(array $lines, bool $noSizeLimit, OutputInterface $output, SymfonyStyle $errorIo): int","+    {","+        $plain = implode(LF, array_map(static fn(StyledText $line): string => $line->plain(), $lines));","+        if ($this->exceedsSizeLimit($plain, $noSizeLimit, $errorIo)) {","+            return Command::FAILURE;","+        }","+        return $this->writeLines($lines, $output);","+    }","+","+    private function writeJson(mixed $data, bool $noSizeLimit, OutputInterface $output, SymfonyStyle $errorIo): int","+    {","+        $json = $this->valueFormatter->json($data);","+        if ($this->exceedsSizeLimit($json, $noSizeLimit, $errorIo)) {","+            return Command::FAILURE;","+        }","+        $output->writeln($json, OutputInterface::OUTPUT_RAW);","+        return Command::SUCCESS;","+    }","+","+    private function exceedsSizeLimit(string $content, bool $noSizeLimit, SymfonyStyle $errorIo): bool","+    {","+        if ($noSizeLimit || strlen($content) <= self::SIZE_LIMIT) {","+            return false;","+        }","+        $errorIo->error(sprintf('Output is %s MB, above the 1 MB limit. Narrow the path or pass --no-size-limit.', number_format(strlen($content) / 1_000_000, 1)));","+        return true;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * The terminal width, 120 columns without a terminal, COLUMNS overriding both.","+     */","+    private function outputWidth(OutputInterface $output): int","+    {","+        $isTerminal = $output instanceof StreamOutput && stream_isatty($output->getStream());","+        $width = getenv('COLUMNS') !== false || $isTerminal ? new Terminal()->getWidth() : self::WIDTH_WITHOUT_TERMINAL;","+        return max(self::MIN_WIDTH, $width);","+    }","+","+    private function registerStyles(OutputInterface $output): void","+    {","+        $formatter = $output->getFormatter();","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_KEY, new OutputFormatterStyle('blue', null, ['bold']));","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_STRING, new OutputFormatterStyle('green'));","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_NUMBER, new OutputFormatterStyle('yellow'));","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_NULL, new OutputFormatterStyle('gray'));","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_DIM, new OutputFormatterStyle('gray'));","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_ELLIPSIS, new OutputFormatterStyle('yellow', null, ['bold']));","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_SECRET, new OutputFormatterStyle('red'));","+        $formatter->setStyle(StyledText::STYLE_MARKER, new OutputFormatterStyle('magenta'));","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * @param list<int|string> $keys","+     */","+    private function didYouMean(string $segment, array $keys): string","+    {","+        $distances = [];","+        foreach ($keys as $key) {","+            $distance = levenshtein($segment, (string)$key);","+            if ($distance <= max(2, intdiv(strlen($segment), 3))) {","+                $distances[(string)$key] = $distance;","+            }","+        }","+        asort($distances);","+        return $distances === [] ? '' : ' Did you mean: ' . $this->valueFormatter->escapeUnsafeCharacters(implode(', ', array_slice(array_keys($distances), 0, 3))) . '?';","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Keys at a path for shell completion, cached briefly as every TAB is a new process.","+     *","+     * @param list<string> $path","+     * @return list<string>","+     */","+    private function keysAt(string $provider, array $path): array","+    {","+        $cacheIdentifier = 'keys_' . sha1($provider . \"\\0\" . implode(\"\\0\", $path));","+        $keys = $this->completionCache->get($cacheIdentifier);","+        if (is_array($keys)) {","+            return $keys;","+        }","+        try {","+            if (!$this->providerRegistry->hasProvider($provider)) {","+                return [];","+            }","+            $data = $this->dataNormalizer->normalize($this->providerRegistry->getProvider($provider)->getConfiguration());","+            foreach ($path as $segment) {","+                if (!is_array($data) || !array_key_exists($segment, $data)) {","+                    return [];","+                }","+                $data = $data[$segment];","+            }","+        } catch (\\Throwable) {","+            return [];","+        }","+        $keys = is_array($data) ? array_map('strval', array_keys($data)) : [];","+        $this->completionCache->set($cacheIdentifier, $keys, [], self::COMPLETION_LIFETIME);","+        return $keys;","+    }","+}"],"additions":363,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/lowlevel/Classes/Inspector/DataNormalizer.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,120 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector;","+","+/**","+ * Turns provider data into plain arrays and scalars, following the rules of the","+ * Configuration module: enums become their value or name, callables their name,","+ * objects arrays of their properties. Values that cannot be shown as data become","+ * a Marker, and cyclic objects are cut with \"*RECURSION*\".","+ *","+ * @internal","+ */","+final readonly class DataNormalizer","+{","+    public function normalize(mixed $value): mixed","+    {","+        return $this->normalizeValue($value, new \\SplObjectStorage());","+    }","+","+    private function normalizeValue(mixed $value, \\SplObjectStorage $ancestors): mixed","+    {","+        if ($value instanceof \\BackedEnum) {","+            return $value->value;","+        }","+        if ($value instanceof \\UnitEnum) {","+            return $value->name;","+        }","+        if (is_float($value) && !is_finite($value)) {","+            return new Marker(is_nan($value) ? 'NAN' : ($value > 0 ? 'INF' : '-INF'));","+        }","+        if (is_string($value)) {","+            // Invalid UTF-8 is replaced by U+FFFD, as the module does via htmlspecialchars().","+            return mb_check_encoding($value, 'UTF-8')","+                ? $value","+                : htmlspecialchars_decode(htmlspecialchars($value, ENT_QUOTES | ENT_SUBSTITUTE, 'UTF-8'), ENT_QUOTES);","+        }","+        // Only arrays and objects: a string that happens to be a function name (\"trim\") is data.","+        if ((is_array($value) || is_object($value)) && is_callable($value, false, $callableName)) {","+            return new Marker($callableName);","+        }","+        if (is_object($value)) {","+            if ($ancestors->offsetExists($value)) {","+                return new Marker('*RECURSION*');","+            }","+            $ancestors->offsetSet($value);","+            $result = $this->normalizeArray(","+                $value instanceof \\Traversable ? $this->iteratorEntries($value) : $this->objectProperties($value),","+                $ancestors","+            );","+            $ancestors->offsetUnset($value);","+            return $result;","+        }","+        if (is_array($value)) {","+            return $this->normalizeArray($value, $ancestors);","+        }","+        if (is_resource($value) || gettype($value) === 'resource (closed)') {","+            return new Marker((string)$value);","+        }","+        return $value;","+    }","+","+    private function normalizeArray(array $array, \\SplObjectStorage $ancestors): array","+    {","+        $result = [];","+        foreach ($array as $key => $item) {","+            $result[$key] = $this->normalizeValue($item, $ancestors);","+        }","+        return $result;","+    }","+","+    private function iteratorEntries(\\Traversable $iterator): array","+    {","+        $entries = [];","+        foreach ($iterator as $key => $item) {","+            $entries[is_int($key) || is_string($key) ? $key : get_debug_type($key)] = $item;","+        }","+        return $entries;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * Properties of an object like an (array) cast, with the null-byte prefixes of protected","+     * and private properties removed. Private properties whose name occurs more than once in","+     * the class hierarchy are prefixed with their declaring class, so none is lost.","+     */","+    private function objectProperties(object $object): array","+    {","+        $parsed = [];","+        $nameCounts = [];","+        foreach ((array)$object as $key => $item) {","+            $key = (string)$key;","+            $class = '';","+            if (str_starts_with($key, \"\\0\")) {","+                [, $class, $key] = explode(\"\\0\", $key, 3);","+            }","+            $parsed[] = [$key, $class, $item];","+            $nameCounts[$key] = ($nameCounts[$key] ?? 0) + 1;","+        }","+        $properties = [];","+        foreach ($parsed as [$name, $class, $item]) {","+            $isPrivate = $class !== '' && $class !== '*';","+            $properties[$nameCounts[$name] > 1 && $isPrivate ? $class . '::' . $name : $name] = $item;","+        }","+        return $properties;","+    }","+}"],"additions":120,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/lowlevel/Classes/Inspector/FlatRenderer.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@","+<?php","+","+declare(strict_types=1);","+","+/*","+ * This file is part of the TYPO3 CMS project.","+ *","+ * It is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under","+ * the terms of the GNU General Public License, either version 2","+ * of the License, or any later version.","+ *","+ * For the full copyright and license information, please read the","+ * LICENSE.txt file that was distributed with this source code.","+ *","+ * The TYPO3 project - inspiring people to share!","+ */","+","+namespace TYPO3\\CMS\\Lowlevel\\Inspector;","+","+/**","+ * Renders normalized data as one line per value: the shell-quoted path relative to","+ * the selection, \" = \", and the value as JSON. A selected single value is the value only.","+ *","+ * @internal","+ */","+final readonly class FlatRenderer","+{","+    pub